{"ref":"BDB, גָּדִי","hw":"גָּדִי","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גָּדִי</span></big>  <strong>adj.gent.</strong> of <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּד</span> <strong>1</strong>, <strong>Gadite</strong> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:36\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.36\">2 S 23:36</a> (so perhaps also ‖ <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.38\">1 Ch 11:38</a> where MT <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגְרִי</span> q.v.; cf. Th Be Dr); elsewhere as n.pr. coll.: so <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.18\">1 Ch 5:18</a> (only here without art., read perhaps <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּד</span> so 𝔊), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.12\">Dt 3:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:43\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.43\">4:43</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 29:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.29.7\">29:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 1:12\" href=\"/Joshua.1.12\">Jos 1:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:6\" href=\"/Joshua.12.6\">12:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:8\" href=\"/Joshua.13.8\">13:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:1\" href=\"/Joshua.22.1\">22:1</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:33\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.33\">2 K 10:33</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:26\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.26\">1 Ch 5:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.8\">12:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:37\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.37\">37</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:32\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.32\">26:32</a>.","next":"BDB, גָּדִי²","prev":"BDB, גָּד"}